13
00:01:24,960 --> 00:01:29,340
make it reasonable? And three is, can I actually,

14
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:36,900
accomplish it? Can I do it? Do I have the skills that I need within me to do the thing I want to

15
00:01:36,900 --> 00:01:43,620
do? And if that's the case, if it all comes together and I have the desire, I do it. The

16
00:01:43,620 --> 00:01:49,500
tricky part is all of these pieces of the puzzle start shifting around on me and shifting around

17
00:01:49,500 --> 00:01:57,640
on you, quite honestly. And so when we say, can I do it for myself? The answer is probably not the

18
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:58,500
way I used to.

19
00:01:59,500 --> 00:02:05,280
Even early on, not the way I used to. So I'm having to learn new things, do it a different

20
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:09,840
way, but so are the people who are trying to support me. And there are things we can do with

21
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:14,580
the environment and the setup to make it better. So I thought we might actually look at some of

22
00:02:14,580 --> 00:02:18,500
the components that people don't always think about. I want to go to the part that we don't

23
00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:25,680
think so much about, which is how aware of the situation and my skills, my changing skills,

