00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:28,600
am I? So it's situation awareness.

25
00:02:28,880 --> 00:02:29,280
How aware?

26
00:02:29,500 --> 00:02:36,420
Where am I? Because the more aware I am, the better probability I'll be safe. And if I do do

