110
00:06:52,740 --> 00:06:54,940
And then can I use it?

111
00:06:55,180 --> 00:06:57,140
Can I actually do this thing?

112
00:06:57,340 --> 00:07:01,620
Sapphires, you either lose it if you don't use it or you keep using it.

113
00:07:01,620 --> 00:07:03,300
But be careful, because if you get

114
00:07:03,500 --> 00:07:06,580
stressed out or fatigued, you have an increased accident risk.

115
00:07:06,780 --> 00:07:08,660
Diamonds, it's going to vary.

116
00:07:08,860 --> 00:07:09,980
It's going to vary during the day.

117
00:07:10,180 --> 00:07:14,420
And with stress, emeralds, to use things, they're going to need support.

118
00:07:14,620 --> 00:07:18,460
But it's awareness support, not push yourself in their support.

119
00:07:18,660 --> 00:07:20,900
And sometimes if you simplify the task a

